#. Translators: Gitea access token help
#: lib/gitea.rb:29
msgid ""
"To generate a new access token from your instance, go to Settings → "
"Applications and generate a new token."
msgstr ""
"Za generiranje novog pristupnog tokena iz svoje instance, idite na Postavke "
"→ Aplikacije i generirajte novi token."

#. Translators: Gitea access token help
#: lib/gitea.rb:35
msgid ""
"Forge Sparks requires the <i>read:issue</i>, <i>write:notification</i> and "
"<i>read:user</i> scopes granted."
msgstr ""
"Forge Sparks zahtijeva odobrene <i>read:issue</i>, <i>write:notification</i> "
"i <i>read:user</i> opsege."

#: lib/github.rb:47
msgid ""
"You can generate a new personal access token from <a href=\"%s\">GitHub "
"developer settings</a>. For more information, see \"<a href=\"%s\">Creating "
"a personal access token</a>\"."
msgstr ""
"Novi osobni pristupni token se može generirati na stranici <a "
"href=\"%s\">GitHub developer settings</a> (Postavke GitHub programera). "
"Dodatne informacije se nalaze u dokumentaciji u odjeljku „<a "
"href=\"%s\">Creating a personal access token</a>“ (Stvaranje osobnog "
"pristupnog tokena)."

#. Translators: GitHub access token help
#: lib/github.rb:57
msgid ""
"Forge Sparks requires a <b>classic</b> access token (for general use) with "
"the <i>notifications</i> and <i>read:user</i> scopes granted."
msgstr ""
"Forge Sparks zahtijeva <b>klasični</b> pristupni token (za opću upotrebu) s "
"odobrenim <i>notifications</i> i <i>read:user</i> ospezima."

#. Translators: GitHub access token help
#: lib/github.rb:63
msgid ""
"If you’re working with private repositories, you’ll also need to grant the "
"full <i>repo</i> scope."
msgstr ""
"Ako radite s privatnim repozitorijima morat ćete dodijeliti i puni <i>repo</"
"i> opseg."

#. Translators: GitLab access token help
#: lib/gitlab.rb:26
msgid ""
"To generate a new access token from your instance, go to Preferences → "
"Access Tokens and generate a new token."
msgstr ""
"Za generiranje novog pristupnog tokena iz svoje instance, idite na Postavke "
"→ Pristupni tokeni i generirajte novi token."

#. Translators: GitLab access token help
#: lib/gitlab.rb:32
msgid ""
"Forge Sparks needs <i>read_api</i> scope to read notifications or full "
"<i>api</i> scope to also mark todos as done."
msgstr ""
"Forge Sparks treba <i>read_api</i> opseg za čitanje obavijesti ili puni "
"opseg <i>API-ja</i> kako bi također označio zadatke kao završene."

